      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6453fa542a9279f2f0e2da1d|full_name}: That would be the best solution, but I guess they didn't wanted to make those data structure sync-able because it can contain references that cannot be synced, like object references. It would be great if we could at least sync certain type of DataTokens.",
